msgid ""
"Learn how to install the development version of the Qiskit Runtime client."
msgstr ""
"Pelajari cara menginstal versi pengembangan dari Qiskit Runtime client."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client from source"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit Runtime client dari sumber"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client from source {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-"
"client-from-source}"
msgstr ""
"Instal Qiskit Runtime client dari sumber {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-"
"client-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you install Qiskit Runtime from source, you can access the current "
"development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package "
"Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest "
"version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda menginstal Qiskit Runtime dari sumber, Anda bisa mengakses versi "
"pengembangan saat ini, bukan menggunakan versi yang ada di repositori Python"
" Package Index (PyPI). Dengan demikian Anda bisa memeriksa dan memperluas "
"versi terbaru kode dengan lebih efisien.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Buat dan aktifkan lingkungan virtual baru {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with "
"only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Navigasikan ke direktori proyekmu dan buat lingkungan minimal yang hanya "
"berisi Python.\n"

