#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Instal Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Ikuti langkah-langkah berikut untuk menginstal Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit Runtime repository.\n"
msgstr "Clone repositori Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "Pindah ke direktori `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Instal `qiskit-runtime`. Kami menyarankan menggunakan [lingkungan "
"virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) untuk menghindari "
"polusi pada instalasi Python global-mu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**Instalasi standar**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mode editable**: Dalam mode ini, Anda tidak perlu menginstal ulang Qiskit "
"saat ada perubahan kode pada proyek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Dalam mode editable, ekstensi yang dikompilasi dibuat dalam _debug mode_"
" tanpa optimasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"(Opsional) Jika Anda ingin menjalankan tes atau pemeriksaan linting, instal "
"persyaratan developer. Kami menyarankan menggunakan [lingkungan "
"virtual](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) untuk menghindari "
"polusi pada instalasi Python global-mu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"  - Baca [panduan kontribusi](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) untuk berkontribusi pada `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Instal Qiskit SDK dari sumber](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Jalankan program pertamamu](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Coba tutorial, seperti [Algoritma Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
